      "en": "They were saying among themselves, “Who will roll away the stone from the door of the tomb for us?”",
      "ko": "서로 말하되 누가 우리를 위하여 무덤 문에서 돌을 굴려 주리요 하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "d23fadccd2c6847c53aadd6300bdce5ea03128aa13748aaa6399b61f8aee5807",
