      "en": "After these things he was revealed in another form to two of them as they walked, on their way into the country.",
      "ko": "그 후에 저희 중 두 사람이 걸어서 시골로 갈때에 예수께서 다른 모양으로 저희에게 나타나시니",
      "source_text_hash": "3abc4cc983e9f64c9115532c06c3da77bb2bdb48aa44aa16c9b818b916c15607",
      "translation_text_hash": "560b9b95118943a2d2f7dbb6b88bb6e8a7f5275f3ed6f6844ee501727bbe3e88",
